<title>AUSTRALIA: Australian P-Notes - Tenders total A$85 mln.</title>
<headline>Australian P-Notes - Tenders total A$85 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian commercial paper market saw three promissory note tenders on Friday totalling A$85 million, including a rare offering from Pioneer International Finance.</p>
<p>Pioneer came with a A$50 million, June 20 dated issue,</p>
<p>fetching 5.56 to 5.57 percent.</p>
